, {"name": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["<Narrator>暴雨砸在面馆的玻璃上，溅起细碎的水花。林晚缩在靠窗的角落，面前的牛肉面早已凉透，手指反复摩挲着温热的瓷杯，目光却黏在门口——她等的人，已经迟到了四十分钟。</Narrator>\n<Narrator>门被猛地推开，风裹着雨丝扑进来，带起一阵凉意。陈屿举着湿透的伞站在门口，头发滴着水，深色外套肩头洇出大片湿痕，目光扫过面馆，很快落在林晚身上。</Narrator>\n<Character1>“抱歉，路上积水堵得厉害，我跑了两条街才过来。”</Character1>\n<Narrator>陈屿快步走到桌前，把伞靠在桌边，坐下时才发现林晚没动筷子，语气里多了点慌乱。</Narrator>\n<Character1>“面都凉了？我再帮你点一碗吧，老板！”</Character1>\n<Narrator>林晚终于抬眼，眼底没什么情绪，却轻轻按住了他要举手的手。</Narrator>\n<Character1>“不用了，我也没怎么饿。”</Character1>\n<Narrator>陈屿看着她指尖的凉意，喉结动了动，从口袋里掏出个用塑料袋裹得严实的小盒子，推到她面前。</Narrator>\n<Character1>“路过你喜欢的那家甜品店，买了芋泥奶冻，没淋到雨，还凉着。”</Character1>"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [398.1966552734375, 449.11407470703125], "pos": [834.1258544921875, 415.5874938964844], "id": 28, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [46], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "seed", "links": [], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"name": "Subtitle", "links": [], "label": "Subtitle", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "Subtitle"}, {"name": "SimplifiedSubtitle", "links": [], "label": "SimplifiedSubtitle", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "SimplifiedSubtitle"}], "color": "#2a363b", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["<Narrator>This is a sample narrative text.<Character1>Hello.<Narrator>He said.", "IndexTTS-1.5", "auto", 1, 3683229344, "randomize", 1, 0.8, 30, 10, 0, 5, 600], "inputs": [{"name": "narrator_audio", "link": 48, "label": "narrator_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "narrator_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "character1_audio", "link": 49, "la